        "text": "One of the most critical changes brought about by global warming is the ongoing reduction of phytoplankton. These tiny plants are an integral food source for ocean life and are responsible for around half of the world's photosynthetic activity. They are the foundations of the oceanic food chain, so a reduction in their numbers creates a knock-on effect that ripples up the entire food chain.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n### 7. \u2620\ufe0f The \"Deadly Trio\"\n",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "These stressors include increased global warming, ocean acidification and increased deoxygenation \u2013 together commonly referred to as climate change\u2019s ...",
