            "type": "web_search_result_location",
            "url": "https://www.eea.europa.eu/en/analysis/publications/how-climate-change-impacts-marine-life"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The three major stressors \u2014 increased global warming, ocean acidification, and increased deoxygenation \u2014 are commonly referred to as climate change's \"deadly trio.\" When these occur at the same time, the synergetic effects damage marine life and ecosystem structure and functions.",
