      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": " ",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "The deadly trio leads to biodiversity loss, and degraded ecosystem functions and structures \u2013 often through non-linear, cascading effects. In parallel...",
