            "type": "web_search_result_location",
            "url": "https://www.eea.europa.eu/en/analysis/publications/how-climate-change-impacts-marine-life"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The deadly trio leads to biodiversity loss and degraded ecosystem functions \u2014 often through non-linear, cascading effects. In parallel, ecosystem services suffer, including reduced catches of commercially important fisheries.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n### 8. \ud83d\udcc8 Projections\n",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
